[FlyWeb 3.1.4] Ported by hand onto 156 (SEGURIDAD-PORTES-24): only the
XMLDocumentParserRs fixes (IsStopped() after CreateElement and per-attribute
setting after a custom element constructor; re-entrant Append()/Finish()
buffered in pending_src_ and deferred to EndInternal(); script start position;
saw_error_ in WellFormed(); no panic on standalone XHTML entities). Left out:
the XSLT-in-Rust parts 156 does not have (saw_xsl_transform_, CAP alerts,
IsXSLTAllowed), the XMLParsingRust status change (already off in 156),
DOMPatchSupport (DevTools) and the web test expectations. In 156 the Rust
parser is used for frameless documents and for SVG documents in frames.
